flowchart TD
classDef general fill:#FFE86D,stroke:#CBB333,color:#574900
classDef decision fill:#A0C4FB,stroke:#6A8BBF,color:#14315E
classDef terminator fill:#DDDDD8,stroke:#A8A8A0,color:#434339
s(["number.Evaluate(NumberContext.Of(x)), where x is a spec,<br/>container, packet, worker context, entity, cue or ItemSpec<br/>tasks call Read(number, data), abilities AbilitySpec.Read"]):::terminator
i["at spec creation, Initialize(spec) takes snapshots:<br/>a times-Attribute read OnCreation, a Randomized roll"]:::general
c{"IsConstant?<br/>no scaler, or UseMagnitude"}:::decision
k(["Constant"]):::terminator
r{"does a NumberKind read what<br/>the context cannot provide?"}:::decision
fb(["Magnitude on the context path, logged once,<br/>or the kind's Fallback on the carrier path"]):::terminator
sc{"which scaler?"}:::decision
nk["a NumberKind: Evaluate(in ctx)<br/>attributes, stacks, Local Data, tracked impacts,<br/>NumberWorkers.TryAsk, set-by-caller, sibling fields, conditions"]:::general
grp["a ScalerGroup: its members,<br/>combined by EGroupOperation"]:::general
pl["a plain scaler: Evaluate(ctx.Carrier),<br/>or through the internal NumberBridge"]:::general
lv["the level: carrier.GetOrigin().GetLevel()<br/>an AbilitySpec or ItemSpec reads Source.GetLevel(assetTag),<br/>an entity its own, a LevelerEffectOrigin its fixed level"]:::general
tb["the table LevelValues, or the Scaling curve<br/>over a max set by ELevelConfig:<br/>LockToLevelProvider, Unlocked or Clamped"]:::general
bh["then the AbstractScalerBehaviour chain"]:::general
cm["combine Magnitude and the scaler by EMagnitudeOperation:<br/>MultiplyWithScaler, AddScaler, UseMagnitude, UseScaler<br/>a ScalableInt then applies its Rounding"]:::general
ip(["in an impact commit, the entry's ValuePipeline.Run<br/>and the modifier stages follow"]):::terminator
s --> i --> c
c -->|yes| k
c -->|no| r
r -->|yes| fb
r -->|no| sc
sc -->|NumberKind| nk
sc -->|ScalerGroup| grp
sc -->|plain| pl
pl --> lv --> tb --> bh
nk --> cm
